  "accepted_scope": [
    "All 264 native footprint identities/values/MPNs/pin nets/DNP/placements agree with the contract; all 260 electrical schematic components and all 779 numbered pads agree with fresh KiCad XML. The four unnumbered mechanical holes are H1..H4.",
    "BOM/pinout recomputation agrees: 99 electronic purchase groups, 249 fitted electronic references, R32/R33/R41/R43 DNP, and 24 VH / 28 XH / 10 PH connected contacts. J20 uses one PHR-2 and the PH contact group uses SPH-002T-P0.5S.",
    "Existing topology is preserved; C164 is the only added footprint. All fixed packages/pads retain exact geometry. U18 body translation is +0.1/+0.05mm with +90deg rotation. New J20 courtyard [107.51,106.8,114.41,112.3]mm lies entirely within old [105.55,102.8,114.41,112.3]mm.",
    "C315 and PH2 retained provenance/asset hashes match the actual project library. This verifies provenance binding, not manufacturer dimensional/assembly qualification.",
    "All 87 priority copper objects exactly match the frozen local-routing stage after the completed restoration/routing/pruning/metadata steps. That local stage added exactly the 87 receipted tracks and no vias.",
    "The previous comparator bypass, remote pullup bypass, immediate feedback/summing detours and same-layer IN/CMP parallel witness have been addressed geometrically. Physical circuit/parasitic qualification stays open.",
    "Both RF rectangles apply to all six copper layers, deny tracks/vias/pads/pours, and have zero expanded trace/via-body, pad-box and actual filled-polygon area intrusions.",
    "The current compact profile has the same numeric circuit as the retained matrix profile; exactly nine nominal_body_mm->maximum_body_mm metadata key renames are the only differences. All 62 current compact decks match retained inputs, all 62 legacy decks match actual matrix-007 decks, and C164 is explicitly present once in every compact deck."
  ],
